direction: right
title: Spark UI Troubleshooting Decision Tree

ScanUI: Spark UI Stages Tab (Event Timeline)

SkewCheck: Are all task bars equal? {
  shape: diamond
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
}

FixSkew: Root Cause: Data Skew {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  Sol1: Enable AQE Skew Join
  Sol2: Salt Hot Keys (rand() * K)
}

GCCheck: GC Time > 10% of Task Time? {
  shape: diamond
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
}

FixGC: Root Cause: GC Thrashing {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  Sol1: Replace UDF with @pandas_udf
  Sol2: Switch to Generational ZGC
}

SpillCheck: Shuffle Disk Spill > 0? {
  shape: diamond
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
}

FixSpill: Root Cause: Memory Starvation {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  Sol1: Increase spark.sql.shuffle.partitions
  Sol2: Increase spark.executor.memory
}

FixOOM: Exit Code 137 (OOMKilled)? {
  style.stroke: "#C084FC"
  Sol: Increase spark.executor.memoryOverhead to 25%
}

ScanUI -> SkewCheck
SkewCheck -> FixSkew: No (One long task) { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
SkewCheck -> GCCheck: Yes { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
GCCheck -> FixGC: Yes (High GC) { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
GCCheck -> SpillCheck: No { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
SpillCheck -> FixSpill: Yes (Spill > 0) { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
SpillCheck -> FixOOM: No { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
